WEBVTT

00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:02.730
Yup, that looks great on you.

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:11.990
You look lovely, Lady Luka.

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:15.840
"Lady"? No, I'm not a lady.

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:16.850
I do beg your pardon.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:19.980
But you are my master's daughter.

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:22.370
Therefore, I shall address you as "Lady."

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:29.800
Alrighty, why don't we go out?

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:31.920
Go out?

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:33.720
Where are we going?

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:39.640
I'm going to introduce you to 
your older brothers and sister.

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:45.270
And I need to go say hi to some people 
who helped me out before we move.

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:46.350
Okay?

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:21.990
<b>An Introduction, a Carriage, a Maid, and Moving</b>

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:21.990
<b>An Introduction, a Carriage, a Maid, and Moving</b>

00:02:28.850 --> 00:02:31.460
I bet it's surprising to see 
this many people, huh?

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:37.170
That's the marketplace. You can find 
anything you want to eat there.

00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:40.080
That's the Adventurers' Guild.

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:46.430
That's where we adventurers get 
a lot of ques—we get a lot of jobs.

00:02:48.010 --> 00:02:49.350
That's the castle.

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:54.020
A castle... Like where a 
king or a princess lives?

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:57.030
Yup, exactly. And...

00:02:57.610 --> 00:03:03.440
This is the Ejidd River. We're going 
to take a boat and head over there.

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:08.660
You adopted her?!

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:13.170
This is Luka, your new little sister.

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:18.590
It's nice to meet you, Luka. I'm Mai-Mai.

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:21.230
You can call me Big Sister Mai-Mai.

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:27.280
Big Sister Mai-Mai...

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:30.180
<i>I love the sound of that!</i>

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:31.470
And that's...

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:33.620
I am Roxilius.

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:37.020
I never knew you had a butler, Mother.

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:40.630
H-Here you go, Miss Cayna, Little Miss Luka.

00:03:40.630 --> 00:03:42.280
Thanks, Lonti.

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:43.360
Thank you...

00:03:44.020 --> 00:03:47.580
Um... Would you like some tea, Roxilius?

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:50.040
I am fine, thank you.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:53.290
I-I see...

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:57.330
You're always full of surprises, Mother.

00:03:57.330 --> 00:04:02.720
You went to look for some Palace of the 
Dragon King and came back with a child.

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:05.640
And when you came to the royal capital...

00:04:05.990 --> 00:04:08.220
You caught a runaway prince,

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:10.850
sent the High Priest flying into the ceiling,

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:15.560
annihilated the bandits that were giving 
the knights trouble all on your own,

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:18.470
and defeated an Event Monster 
like it was child's play.

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:23.140
Mother, your life is so eventful.

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:29.030
<i>I can't help but think I'm some 
kind of deterrent in this world.</i>

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:31.200
By the way, Mai-Mai...

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:34.600
Now that I've got a new daughter named Luka,

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:37.810
I'm going to build a house near my tower,

00:04:37.810 --> 00:04:40.110
and I'm going to settle down there.

00:04:40.110 --> 00:04:41.880
Not in the royal capital?

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:46.730
I want Luka to grow up carefree 
and surrounded by nature.

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:48.010
Besides, if I stay here,

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:51.060
I'm afraid Skargo will try 
to attack me every day.

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:52.890
True...

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:53.730
True...

00:04:54.090 --> 00:04:55.260
<i>True.</i>

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:58.400
Now, then...

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:04.490
I'm going to go see Skargo and Kartatz. 
Could you let them know for me?

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:08.320
Could you also tell Kartatz, "I'm going 
to build a house, so I'd love some lumber.

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:11.410
It'd make me so happy to have a lot."

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:13.220
Very well.

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:19.840
Ah, a new little sister!

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:25.820
Welcome to our family!

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:34.180
Skargo...

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:38.210
I'm very sorry, Mother Dearest!

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:43.490
It's okay. He's just a weirdo. 
He's not actually scary.

00:05:43.490 --> 00:05:45.320
He's just a weirdo?

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:47.590
Let's try these introductions again.

00:05:48.170 --> 00:05:50.660
This is my son, Skargo.

00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:54.540
Big Brother Skargo?

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.750
Ah, my precious little sister!

00:05:56.750 --> 00:06:02.090
Just think of him as your pathetic, 
weird older brother, who holds a high rank,

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:05.380
but is only remembered for 
producing his own special effects.

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:06.130
'Kay.

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:09.350
Mother Dearest, you don't have 
to say it like that...

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:10.680
You deserve every word of it.

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:13.100
But, Mother Dearest...

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:18.670
These effects are what make me 
who I am. They are my identity!

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:20.940
I'm telling you to get rid of that identity.

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:26.440
But... you're the one who raised 
me to be this way, are you not?

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:30.860
<i>He's got a point, Cayna.</i>

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:33.550
<i>So this lad is Master's son.</i>

00:06:34.980 --> 00:06:36.290
<i>I see.</i>

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:44.090
So, yeah. I'm going to be living 
in the village near my tower.

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:47.010
If you need anything, 
you can contact me there.

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:51.800
Very well. In that case, I think I'll 
also move my church over there—

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:52.930
Yeah, don't.

00:06:55.170 --> 00:06:56.010
Mother Dearest...

00:06:57.880 --> 00:07:00.550
Okay, I'll be taking all of this.

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:06.550
That should be plenty.

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:07.530
Yup.

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:12.950
This should be plenty to build 
a house or two. Thanks, Kartatz.

00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:16.630
I'm not a kid. Stop patting me on the head.

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:24.710
You're my little sister, huh?
 Pleased to meet ya.

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:28.600
It's nice to meet you.

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:30.800
What a good little lass.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:33.570
You're such a good boy, Kartatz.

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:35.480
Damn it, stop patting my head.

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:38.750
You're so personable, unlike Skargo.

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:40.600
I wonder if it's because 
you're so old and wise.

00:07:40.900 --> 00:07:45.630
Old and wise? You're way older than I am.

00:07:46.890 --> 00:07:48.270
Ah, I see.

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:51.690
So you've adopted a daughter.

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:56.840
And you're moving to that village?
 We sure will miss you.

00:07:56.840 --> 00:07:59.790
It's not like we'll never 
see each other again.

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:05.500
I was hoping you'd be our 
caravan's dedicated bodyguard.

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:09.310
And we wanted you to join 
the Flame Spears, too.

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:13.010
I guess we'll just have to give up.

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:13.910
Yeah.

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:19.850
You can call me at any time, though 
I may not be able to help every time.

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:22.270
Oh, by the way, Cayna...

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:25.520
Moving will be an expensive proposition.

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:27.440
Yes, I'm sure it will.

00:08:27.810 --> 00:08:30.140
If you need anything,

00:08:30.140 --> 00:08:35.110
please stop by my shop. 
I assure you, it's got everything.

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:43.350
Maybe she's tuckered out from 
meeting so many new people.

00:08:45.060 --> 00:08:47.570
I'll try to get us a ride for our journey.

00:08:47.570 --> 00:08:50.110
Could you take Luka back to the inn for me?

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:54.510
You can count on me. 
Where are you headed, Master?

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:58.450
I figured I'd stop by Elineh's 
shop since I'm here.

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:06.430
That's, uh...

00:09:06.950 --> 00:09:11.110
<i>Elineh has been beautified by 300 percent.</i>

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:18.130
One Cayna... Two Caynas?!

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:22.410
Meow, meow. Meow, meow. Meow, meow...

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:24.040
Are you trying to change your image?

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:35.840
Hello?

00:09:36.460 --> 00:09:39.590
Welcome. Is this your first time here?

00:09:39.590 --> 00:09:41.070
Oh, yes.

00:09:41.070 --> 00:09:45.180
<i>This employee is another 
kobold, just like Elineh.</i>

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:48.580
Um, what kind of shop is this?

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:54.630
We have everything from household items 
to swords you can use as an adventurer.

00:09:54.630 --> 00:09:55.800
Uh-huh...

00:09:55.800 --> 00:10:01.920
<i>I see. It's probably like Ama•••. 
I definitely used •••zon a lot.</i>

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:04.330
<i>I got my stuff immediately, 
even at the hospital.</i>

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:05.680
Miss?

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:09.750
Oh, um... I was looking to buy 
a carriage. Do you have one?

00:10:10.120 --> 00:10:12.590
We have everything other
than the things we don't have.

00:10:12.980 --> 00:10:15.940
Ooh! Way to go, Ama••• Prime!

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:17.470
Right this way, please.

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:22.740
These are our latest models.

00:10:22.740 --> 00:10:25.310
Wow, there are a lot to choose from.

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:27.890
This one is an older model,

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:30.250
but its elaborate decorations 
make it quite popular.

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:32.010
It's so fancy.

00:10:32.010 --> 00:10:35.280
<i>I mean, pretty much 
anything will work, but...</i>

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:40.190
That one is not for sale,

00:10:40.190 --> 00:10:43.590
but it's the model our caravan 
had been using until recently.

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:46.580
It's old now, so it's slated for disposal.

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:49.500
<i>So that's the one Elineh was using?</i>

00:10:50.150 --> 00:10:53.810
<i>Come to think of it, it does look familiar.</i>

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:58.600
That's the one that was attacked 
by the laigayanma larva.

00:10:58.600 --> 00:10:59.470
Oh!

00:11:00.390 --> 00:11:02.520
Please excuse my rudeness!

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:04.800
Huh?

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:10.230
Would your name happen to be Miss Cayna?

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:13.150
Uh... Yeah, it is.

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:15.070
Very well!

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:18.650
Then you needn't pay for this item.

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:21.490
Please go ahead and take it.

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:22.630
What?!

00:11:22.630 --> 00:11:23.910
Miss Cayna,

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:27.640
I'm sure you must be wondering why,

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:29.580
but those are the president's orders.

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:33.140
President... You mean Elineh?

00:11:33.140 --> 00:11:33.990
Yes.

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:36.510
He just instructed me

00:11:36.510 --> 00:11:42.430
to let you have your first purchase 
for free if you stopped by.

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:48.350
I appreciate it, but Elineh 
doesn't need to do that for me.

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:52.270
You're just as my husband said you'd be.

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:53.390
Husband?

00:11:53.390 --> 00:11:55.190
I should've mentioned this earlier.

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:59.110
My name is Armuna. I am Elineh's wife.

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:00.740
What?!

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:04.610
Oh, hello! It's a pleasure to meet you!

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:07.680
Oh, please! You don't need to bow!

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:11.580
I had no idea Elineh was married.

00:12:11.920 --> 00:12:15.500
My husband deeply appreciates 
everything you've done for him.

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:19.420
Please consider this a token of our 
gratitude and a housewarming gift.

00:12:19.650 --> 00:12:22.300
Okay... If you say so.

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:26.270
Yes. What shall we do? Would you 
like it delivered to the inn later?

00:12:26.270 --> 00:12:28.350
No, I'll just take it with me.

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:30.270
Take it with you?

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:32.560
<b>Item Box</b>

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:32.560
<b>Elineh's Carriage</b>

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:33.850
Like this.

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:34.980
Oh, I see.

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:38.900
Please come again.

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:44.820
Sure. Next time, I'll do some real 
shopping. Say hi to Elineh for me.

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:47.820
I will. We'll be waiting for your return.

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:51.980
We'll be waiting for your return.

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:55.350
Right...

00:12:56.970 --> 00:12:58.290
So, yeah.

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:00.450
We're going to be leaving tomorrow.

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:04.500
We'll go to the village, 
build a house, and live there.

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:06.220
What should I do?

00:13:06.540 --> 00:13:12.140
Hmm... I guess you can do some chores 
for a while. Like cleaning up and stuff.

00:13:12.490 --> 00:13:15.810
I don't actually know what 
household chores are like.

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:20.150
I was always at the hospital, 
so I wasn't home much.

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:24.820
<i>I wonder what kinds of 
household chores are essential.</i>

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:30.660
<i>I guess I can ask a professional housekeeper.</i>

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:32.450
So, Rox...

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:34.330
Yes, Master?

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:38.250
I don't know what I should 
have Luka do at our new home.

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:44.770
I see... Then why don't I run 
everything in your household?

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:48.650
What? But your statute of limitations...

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:53.350
You're making it sound like 
I've committed a crime.

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:55.640
Wait, are you going away?

00:13:55.640 --> 00:14:02.570
Well, you see... There is nothing 
left in the place where I once was.

00:14:02.830 --> 00:14:05.870
I'm not even sure if I can return there.

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:07.740
Ah, I see.

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:10.780
<i>Since </i>Leadale<i>'s not running anymore,</i>

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:14.740
<i>I guess maybe all the systems 
that were in place are in limbo.</i>

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:16.660
In that case...

00:14:16.880 --> 00:14:20.300
Can I have you look after 
Luka at our new home?

00:14:20.300 --> 00:14:21.470
Of course.

00:14:21.830 --> 00:14:25.650
Isn't that great? Rox will 
teach you all kinds of things.

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:26.330
Yeah.

00:14:26.330 --> 00:14:28.880
Also, if I may...

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:30.600
Huh? What did you need?

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:33.310
I was wondering if you could summon Roxine.

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:34.880
Summon Cie?

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:38.980
I believe it would be beneficial to 
Lady Luka if she had a female attendant.

00:14:39.240 --> 00:14:43.900
Though I would much rather 
not ask her for anything.

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:47.040
I guess you two never got along very well.

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:50.820
If she didn't start these petty squabbles, 
I would never retaliate.

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:53.740
I see. I guess we're calling Cie, too.

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:57.200
That actually sounds like 
it'll be pretty fun.

00:14:57.200 --> 00:14:58.550
Let's not wait.

00:15:20.110 --> 00:15:23.020
It has been too long, Lady Cayna.

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:26.300
I, Roxine, am at your service.

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:28.400
It's been a while, Cie.

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:31.910
Seeing that you have summoned me 
while this numbskull is already here,

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:35.280
is it safe to assume that this 
numbskull acted inappropriately?

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:39.700
Cie, this is Luka, my daughter.

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:43.000
My name is Roxine.

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:46.840
I-I'm Luka.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:51.260
I'd like you to take care 
of Luka at our new home.

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:52.750
As you wish.

00:15:52.750 --> 00:15:56.370
I, Roxine, I will make sure to 
raise Lady Luka into a fine lady

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:59.930
who will never bring you shame, 
wherever she may go.

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:02.670
Uh, you don't need to raise her into a lady.

00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:06.860
Just raise her normally 
so she can be herself.

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:09.530
I see. Very well.

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:13.500
Meaning, you are requesting 
the minimal amount of care.

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:19.700
Yeah, just let her be. I don't think she's 
used to people pampering her so much.

00:16:20.110 --> 00:16:22.130
Um... take care of me?

00:16:22.130 --> 00:16:24.410
From getting dressed in the morning
to your bath at night,

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:26.460
Roxine will help you with everything.

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:30.130
But I don't deserve any of that.

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:33.050
Then let's have them take care of both of us.

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:34.620
Is that better?

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:36.970
Okay...

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:40.290
But honestly, if you were going to 
bother summoning this numbskull,

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:43.250
you could've summoned me first.

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:46.150
Who are you calling a numbskull? 
Know your place.

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:50.220
You and I both live to serve our master.

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:56.490
<i>They really don't get along, 
even though they're so much alike.</i>

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:05.870
We're all going to be a family, 
so try not to fight so much.

00:17:06.100 --> 00:17:09.620
No cutting down trees in 
the city, destroying homes,

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:11.800
or throwing people, either!

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:16.720
Make sure you behave yourselves
 so you can set an example for Luka.

00:17:16.960 --> 00:17:21.060
I owe a lot to the village 
we're about to live in.

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:24.630
If you mess with the people or the 
common property, I'll get mad.

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:28.080
Very well, Lady Cayna.

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:29.820
Understood.

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:31.410
Jeez...

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:41.580
All right, let's go!

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:44.810
Where's the horse? This carriage 
won't move without one.

00:17:44.810 --> 00:17:47.030
Oh, don't you worry your pretty little head.

00:17:47.030 --> 00:17:48.000
Just watch.

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:57.510
Don't be frightened, Lady Luka.

00:17:57.510 --> 00:18:01.930
Yes. It's not as frightening 
as Roxine, Lady Luka.

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:03.420
What was that?

00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:04.690
You must be hearing things.

00:18:04.690 --> 00:18:05.440
Tch...

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:15.370
Well done, Master.

00:18:15.370 --> 00:18:17.310
Excellent, Lady Cayna.

00:18:17.310 --> 00:18:19.110
All right. Hop in.

00:18:21.070 --> 00:18:22.830
Let's go!

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:35.580
I'm thinking about moving here 
with my daughter and attendants.

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:37.130
I hope you don't mind.

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:44.540
Oh, I see. All right. I'm sure everyone 
will be happy you're here, Cayna.

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:47.900
So you're going to stay here forever, Miss?

00:18:47.900 --> 00:18:49.560
It's sure gonna get lively.

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:55.050
I'm Lytt. I'm the daughter 
of this pub's owner.

00:18:55.050 --> 00:18:56.400
It's nice to meet you.

00:18:59.350 --> 00:19:02.410
I'm Luka. It's nice to meet you.

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:04.430
Yeah! Let's be friends!

00:19:06.050 --> 00:19:09.370
Oh, sorry. Did that hurt?

00:19:10.010 --> 00:19:12.540
No... I'm okay.

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:14.540
Thank goodness!

00:19:16.510 --> 00:19:21.010
Luka, was it? I hope she enjoys living here.

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:21.990
Yes.

00:19:21.990 --> 00:19:24.180
So... who are these two?

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:26.750
I apologize for my late introduction.

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:30.190
I will also be living here along 
with Lady Cayna as her attendant.

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:33.170
My name is Roxilius.

00:19:33.170 --> 00:19:36.090
It is a pleasure to meet you.

00:19:36.090 --> 00:19:42.110
Yes, he is nothing but a lowly servant.
 Please use him as you will.

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:45.820
Use him like you would a dirty rag, 
until there's naught but fur left.

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:51.460
I am also an attendant. My name is Roxine.
 It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:55.120
What a rather mean, er, 
unique attendant you've got there.

00:19:55.120 --> 00:19:56.380
I'm so sorry.

00:19:56.690 --> 00:20:02.300
<i>Once our house is done, it'll probably 
be best not to let Roxine out too much.</i>

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:06.210
So considering you've got 
these nice attendants,

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:10.310
you must be from an important family.

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:14.320
It's actually a long story...
 More importantly,

00:20:14.320 --> 00:20:16.390
how's Mimily doing?

00:20:16.390 --> 00:20:18.230
Oh, Mimily is...

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:21.150
<i>There is a song</i>

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:23.070
<i>That you can only hear</i>

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:28.220
<i>On a night with shooting stars</i>

00:20:28.220 --> 00:20:33.040
<i>The blue wave guides my fin</i>

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.690
She's doing laundry.

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:33.040
Why is Mimily doing laundry?

00:20:33.310 --> 00:20:39.500
Lytt found out that I can control water, 
so she suggested I run a laundry business.

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:46.530
Lytt ended up telling everyone in town 
before I could give a proper answer,

00:20:46.530 --> 00:20:49.220
and then this happened.

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:53.640
I guess I underestimated 
how proactive kids are.

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:56.560
Yes, but I'm having fun.

00:20:57.160 --> 00:20:59.470
It makes everyone in the village happy,

00:20:59.470 --> 00:21:03.490
and I can earn a wage, so it's 
killing two birds with one stone.

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:06.890
She always gets everything 
so clean. It's a huge help.

00:21:06.890 --> 00:21:10.950
We don't have to spend time 
on laundry, which is great.

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:12.110
Yeah.

00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:13.910
It's wonderful.

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:15.600
I see.

00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:17.320
<i>She's pretty reliable.</i>

00:21:17.320 --> 00:21:19.060
<i>Lullaby...</i>

00:21:19.060 --> 00:21:24.260
Well, I need to start the preparations, 
so I'll be heading back now.

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:25.350
Preparations?

00:21:25.350 --> 00:21:26.410
For what?

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:28.180
What else?

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:33.320
We're throwing a welcome party 
to celebrate you two living here.

00:21:33.320 --> 00:21:34.850
It's going to be huge!

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:36.900
We're having a huge feast tonight!

00:21:37.640 --> 00:21:38.270
Okay.

00:21:38.270 --> 00:21:41.260
N-No, I'm good on parties...

00:21:41.260 --> 00:21:42.690
What are you talking about?

00:21:43.050 --> 00:21:45.850
You're officially becoming 
a member of our village.

00:21:46.190 --> 00:21:49.410
A welcome party is a necessary ritual.

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:54.330
Uh, well... Okay, but please go easy on me.

00:21:57.620 --> 00:22:01.670
<i>Looks like you're going to get black-out 
drunk and have a hangover again.</i>
